# Files that live in dist/ but must NOT be uploaded as Cloudflare static assets.
# Read by `wrangler deploy` from the assets directory (dist/), which is where
# Vite copies this file from public/.

# Precompressed sidecars. These exist for Apache/LiteSpeed on Hostinger, which
# size-caps on-the-fly compression (see public/.htaccess). Cloudflare compresses
# at the edge, so uploading these would ship a second, unreachable copy of every
# asset and burn file-count budget for nothing.
*.br
*.gz

# Apache config. Inert on Cloudflare, and served as a readable text file at
# /.htaccess if uploaded — a small config disclosure for zero benefit.
.htaccess
